1
00:00:02,005 --> 00:00:04,135
Book eight is Tiamat's Wrath.

2
00:00:04,155 --> 00:00:05,755
Laconia rules the gates,

3
00:00:05,775 --> 00:00:08,255
and the Rocinante crew is scattered.

4
00:00:08,275 --> 00:00:10,355
Holden is Duarte's prisoner.

5
00:00:10,375 --> 00:00:12,680
Naomi runs the underground.

6
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:15,400
Bobbie and Alex fight on near Jupiter.

7
00:00:15,525 --> 00:00:17,580
And Elvi Okoye is sent to study

8
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,280
the enemy that killed the gate builders.

9
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,680
Four stories, and a war with something

10
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,755
far older than Laconia.

11
00:00:24,775 --> 00:00:26,075
Spoilers ahead!

12
00:00:26,824 --> 00:00:29,354
Story one: Elvi Okoye,

13
00:00:29,374 --> 00:00:31,379
the scientist from Ilus.

14
00:00:31,399 --> 00:00:33,204
Laconia puts her in charge of a

15
00:00:33,224 --> 00:00:35,504
science mission, with her husband Fayez at

16
00:00:35,524 --> 00:00:36,704
her side.

17
00:00:36,724 --> 00:00:39,604
They visit dead systems beyond the gates.

18
00:00:39,624 --> 00:00:41,729
In one, they find a planet sized

19
00:00:41,749 --> 00:00:43,379
diamond that turns out to be a

20
00:00:43,399 --> 00:00:46,129
library, a record left by the gate

21
00:00:46,149 --> 00:00:47,104
builders.

22
00:00:47,124 --> 00:00:48,889
It shows what happened to them.

23
00:00:49,545 --> 00:00:51,450
The builders were wiped out by beings

24
00:00:51,470 --> 00:00:54,050
that live outside normal space.

25
00:00:54,070 --> 00:00:55,975
Duarte wants to fight them.

26
00:00:55,995 --> 00:00:57,850
At a system called Tecoma,

27
00:00:57,870 --> 00:01:00,850
his scientists fire an antimatter weapon into

28
00:01:00,870 --> 00:01:02,475
a neutron star.

29
00:01:02,495 --> 00:01:03,865
The star collapses,

30
00:01:03,885 --> 00:01:06,215
and the blast tears through the gates.

31
00:01:06,235 --> 00:01:08,040
Then the beings answer.

32
00:01:08,060 --> 00:01:09,115
In one instant,

33
00:01:09,135 --> 00:01:11,815
Medina Station and everything inside the Ring

34
00:01:11,835 --> 00:01:12,859
is wiped out.

35
00:01:13,518 --> 00:01:16,173
Story two: Holden and Teresa.

36
00:01:16,193 --> 00:01:18,623
Holden is kept in Duarte's palace,

37
00:01:18,643 --> 00:01:20,048
a prisoner who is allowed to walk

38
00:01:20,068 --> 00:01:21,048
the halls.

39
00:01:21,068 --> 00:01:23,098
He sees Duarte change.

40
00:01:23,118 --> 00:01:25,298
The protomolecule in his body has left

41
00:01:25,318 --> 00:01:27,323
him lost in his own mind.

42
00:01:27,343 --> 00:01:29,673
His teenage daughter Teresa is being raised

43
00:01:29,693 --> 00:01:31,148
to rule after him.

44
00:01:31,168 --> 00:01:33,848
Holden learns that Cortazar plans to make

45
00:01:33,868 --> 00:01:35,748
her his next experiment.

46
00:01:35,768 --> 00:01:37,823
When Cortazar goes too far,

47
00:01:37,843 --> 00:01:39,771
Duarte wakes up and kills him.

48
00:01:40,457 --> 00:01:42,287
Teresa has a secret friend in the

49
00:01:42,307 --> 00:01:44,687
woods, a scarred man who calls himself

50
00:01:44,707 --> 00:01:45,782
Timothy.

51
00:01:45,832 --> 00:01:47,412
He is really Amos,

52
00:01:47,432 --> 00:01:50,067
hiding on Laconia with a nuclear bomb,

53
00:01:50,087 --> 00:01:52,592
waiting for a chance to free Holden.

54
00:01:52,612 --> 00:01:55,017
Laconian guards shoot him dead.

55
00:01:55,037 --> 00:01:56,667
But his body is taken by the

56
00:01:56,687 --> 00:02:00,067
strange dogs, the same alien machines from

57
00:02:00,087 --> 00:02:01,867
Laconia's forests.

58
00:02:01,887 --> 00:02:03,342
They bring Amos back,

59
00:02:03,362 --> 00:02:04,309
changed.

60
00:02:05,019 --> 00:02:07,949
Story three: Bobbie and Alex.

61
00:02:07,969 --> 00:02:11,699
Flying the captured Laconian warship Gathering Storm,

62
00:02:11,719 --> 00:02:15,344
they raid Laconian supply lines near Jupiter.

63
00:02:15,459 --> 00:02:17,289
In one raid they take a cargo

64
00:02:17,309 --> 00:02:19,189
of antimatter weapons.

65
00:02:19,209 --> 00:02:21,039
Now they have something that might hurt

66
00:02:21,059 --> 00:02:22,689
the Heart of the Tempest,

67
00:02:22,709 --> 00:02:25,340
the warship that conquered the solar system.

68
00:02:26,150 --> 00:02:28,905
Alex draws the Tempest's attention while Bobbie

69
00:02:28,925 --> 00:02:30,950
flies in with the bomb.

70
00:02:31,085 --> 00:02:32,590
At the last moment she has to

71
00:02:32,610 --> 00:02:34,465
leave the shuttle and throw the bomb

72
00:02:34,485 --> 00:02:36,550
by hand, and she knows she won't

73
00:02:36,570 --> 00:02:37,575
get out.

74
00:02:37,595 --> 00:02:39,175
The Tempest is destroyed,

75
00:02:39,195 --> 00:02:41,070
and Bobbie dies with it.

76
00:02:41,175 --> 00:02:42,930
Across the solar system,

77
00:02:42,950 --> 00:02:44,405
people who had given up start to

78
00:02:44,425 --> 00:02:45,358
fight back.

79
00:02:46,088 --> 00:02:48,443
Story four: Naomi.

80
00:02:48,463 --> 00:02:50,518
She leads the resistance from hiding,

81
00:02:50,538 --> 00:02:52,463
moving from ship to ship.

82
00:02:52,588 --> 00:02:54,648
She makes her way to Auberon,

83
00:02:54,668 --> 00:02:56,423
one of the richest worlds beyond the

84
00:02:56,443 --> 00:02:59,283
gates, and takes over its underground.

85
00:02:59,303 --> 00:03:01,508
From there, she starts calling in help

86
00:03:01,528 --> 00:03:04,695
from every colony that Laconia has squeezed.

87
00:03:05,416 --> 00:03:07,821
Naomi gathers hundreds of ships for one

88
00:03:07,841 --> 00:03:09,441
surprise strike.

89
00:03:09,551 --> 00:03:11,681
They come through the Laconia gate together

90
00:03:11,701 --> 00:03:14,306
and destroy the alien platforms in orbit

91
00:03:14,326 --> 00:03:16,756
that build Laconia's warships.

92
00:03:16,776 --> 00:03:17,971
On the ground,

93
00:03:17,991 --> 00:03:20,691
Teresa uses Amos's beacon to call for

94
00:03:20,711 --> 00:03:23,021
a rescue, and she brings Holden out

95
00:03:23,041 --> 00:03:24,516
of his cell with her.

96
00:03:24,536 --> 00:03:26,341
The crew is together again,

97
00:03:26,361 --> 00:03:27,591
all but Bobbie.

98
00:03:28,256 --> 00:03:30,636
Book eight ends with Laconia broken but

99
00:03:30,656 --> 00:03:31,981
not beaten.

100
00:03:32,131 --> 00:03:34,461
Teresa leaves with the Rocinante,

101
00:03:34,481 --> 00:03:36,736
running from her father's empire.

102
00:03:36,756 --> 00:03:38,101
Duarte is gone,

103
00:03:38,121 --> 00:03:41,071
changed into something no one understands.

104
00:03:41,181 --> 00:03:43,511
And the beings outside space are waking

105
00:03:43,531 --> 00:03:46,911
up, while humanity is still fighting itself.

106
00:03:46,931 --> 00:03:48,611
Next up: book nine,

107
00:03:48,631 --> 00:03:50,159
Leviathan Falls.

